# Search-tool ignore list (ripgrep and tools built on it, including AI coding agents' search).
# Fixtures and examples quote untrusted agent-security data (prompt-injection payloads); keep them out of
# broad searches so their text is not pulled into an agent's context by accident. Open them deliberately.
tests/fixtures/
tests/golden/
docs/architecture/examples/**/*.jsonl
.claude/worktrees/
